00:22:30.227 --> 00:22:32.097
And then found himself
wanted for killings

00:22:32.258 --> 00:22:34.177
He claimed were the work
of an invisible force,

00:22:34.761 --> 00:22:36.174
Killings carried
out --Get this --

00:22:36.669 --> 00:22:37.838
With a sharp instrument.

00:22:38.027 --> 00:22:39.129
What's the connection to lori?

00:22:39.739 --> 00:22:42.955
A man of religion who openly
preaches against immorality.

00:22:44.387 --> 00:22:47.009
Except this time instead
of saving the whole town,

00:22:47.009 --> 00:22:48.673
He's trying to save his only daughter.

00:22:48.673 --> 00:22:49.909
Reverend sorenson.

00:22:50.567 --> 00:22:51.874
Do you think he's summoning the spirit?

00:22:52.362 --> 00:22:53.052
Maybe.

00:22:55.050 --> 00:22:56.928
Or you know how a poltergeist

00:22:56.928 --> 00:22:58.664
Can haunt a person instead of a place?

00:22:59.079 --> 00:23:01.470
The spirit latches onto the
reverend's repressed emotions,

00:23:01.470 --> 00:23:02.302
Feeds off them.

00:23:04.138 --> 00:23:05.870
Without the reverend
ever even knowing it.

00:23:08.178 --> 00:23:10.565
Either way,  you should
keep an eye on lori tonight.

00:23:11.179 --> 00:23:12.109
What about you?

00:23:18.036 --> 00:23:19.969
I'm gonna go see if I can
find that unmarked grave.

00:24:19.814 --> 00:24:21.713
Here we go.

00:24:58.950 --> 00:25:00.158
That's it.

00:25:00.744 --> 00:25:04.431
Next time,  I get to watch
the cute girl's house.

00:25:18.578 --> 00:25:19.892
Hello,  preacher.

00:25:37.415 --> 00:25:40.020
I saw you from upstairs.

00:25:41.402 --> 00:25:42.884
What are you doing here?

00:25:44.746 --> 00:25:46.649
I'm keeping an eye on the place.

00:25:49.407 --> 00:25:50.764
I was worried.

00:25:50.764 --> 00:25:51.974
About me?

00:25:52.146 --> 00:25:53.839
Yeah,  sorry.

00:25:55.480 --> 00:25:56.760
No,  it's cool.

00:25:58.357 --> 00:25:59.562
I already called the cops.

00:26:02.244 --> 00:26:04.603
No,  seriously, I think you're sweet,

00:26:05.450 --> 00:26:08.139
Which is probably why you
should run away from me

00:26:08.139 --> 00:26:09.402
As fast as you can.

00:26:11.467 --> 00:26:12.882
Why would you say that?

00:26:13.951 --> 00:26:15.699
It's like I'm cursed or something.

00:26:16.438 --> 00:26:18.219
People around me keep dying.

00:26:22.364 --> 00:26:23.852
I thinkI know how you feel.

00:26:50.929 --> 00:26:52.323
Goodbye,  preacher.

00:27:05.237 --> 00:27:06.811
No one will talk to me anymore...

00:27:07.731 --> 00:27:08.812
Except you.

00:27:09.300 --> 00:27:11.099
The sheriff thinks I'm a suspect.

00:27:12.217 --> 00:27:13.581
And you know what my dad will say?

00:27:13.650 --> 00:27:15.473
"Pave faith."

00:27:15.785 --> 00:27:17.636
What does he know about faith?

00:27:20.447 --> 00:27:22.221
I heard you guys fighting before.

00:27:23.966 --> 00:27:27.398
He's seeing a woman, a married woman.

00:27:27.581 --> 00:27:28.871
I just found out.

00:27:30.189 --> 00:27:32.354
She comes to our
church with her husband,

00:27:32.698 --> 00:27:34.290
I know her kids,

00:27:34.815 --> 00:27:38.263
And he talks to me about
religion, about morality?

00:27:39.999 --> 00:27:41.614
It's like on one hand, you know,

00:27:42.354 --> 00:27:43.897
Just do what you want and be happy,

00:27:44.729 --> 00:27:46.878
But he
taught me --

00:27:46.996 --> 00:27:50.076
Raised me to believe that
if you do something wrong,

00:27:50.156 --> 00:27:51.286
You will get punished.

00:27:55.351 --> 00:27:57.550
I just don't know what to think anymore.

00:28:26.665 --> 00:28:27.672
Sam?

00:28:28.229 --> 00:28:29.924
Lori,  I can'T.

00:28:31.755 --> 00:28:33.600
That someone you lost?

00:28:37.584 --> 00:28:39.129
I'm sorry.

00:28:39.260 --> 00:28:39.976
Lori.

00:28:42.436 --> 00:28:44.271
Come inside,  please.

00:28:45.311 --> 00:28:47.047
I'll come in when I'm ready.

00:28:49.536 --> 00:28:51.411
Ack! Aah!

00:28:59.157 --> 00:29:00.746
No! No!

00:29:16.366 --> 00:29:17.195
Dad!

00:29:23.403 --> 00:29:24.948
It's okay.It's all right.

00:29:24.948 --> 00:29:26.404
It's okay. It's okay.

00:29:29.942 --> 00:29:30.937
We were just talking.

00:29:31.540 --> 00:29:35.285
Then lori's dad came
out, and then he appeared.

00:29:35.667 --> 00:29:39.227
A big man carrying a
weapon,  some kind of a hook?

00:29:39.432 --> 00:29:40.460
Yes,  sir.

00:29:41.198 --> 00:29:42.374
Ever seen him before?

00:29:44.254 --> 00:29:45.095
No,  sir.

00:29:46.842 --> 00:29:49.178
Son,  it seems every time I
turn around,  I'm seeing you.

00:29:51.099 --> 00:29:52.786
I suggest you try to
stay out of trouble.

00:29:54.430 --> 00:29:55.225
Yes,  sir.

00:29:56.199 --> 00:29:57.365
It's all right.I'm with him.

00:29:57.381 --> 00:30:00.030
That's my brother.Hey,  brother.

00:30:04.217 --> 00:30:05.257
Let him through.

00:30:05.589 --> 00:30:06.748
Thanks.

00:30:09.186 --> 00:30:10.165
Go ahead.

00:30:14.787 --> 00:30:15.264
You okay?

00:30:15.264 --> 00:30:15.809
Yeah.

00:30:16.336 --> 00:30:17.345
What the hell happened?

00:30:17.805 --> 00:30:18.606
Hookman.

00:30:18.959 --> 00:30:19.729
You saw him?

00:30:19.766 --> 00:30:20.538
Damn right.

00:30:20.712 --> 00:30:21.653
Why didn't you torch the bones?

00:30:21.653 --> 00:30:25.294
I did. Are you sure it's
the spirit of jacob karns?

00:30:25.294 --> 00:30:27.956
Sure as hell looked like
him. And that's not all.

00:30:28.294 --> 00:30:30.311
I don't think the spirit is
latching onto the reverend.

00:30:30.601 --> 00:30:32.720
Yeah,  the guy wouldn't send
the hookman after himself.

00:30:35.567 --> 00:30:37.088
I think it's latching onto lori.

00:30:37.832 --> 00:30:39.337
Last night she found out that her father

00:30:39.337 --> 00:30:41.186
Is having an affair
with a married woman.

00:30:41.342 --> 00:30:42.326
So what?

00:30:42.326 --> 00:30:43.390
So,  she's upset about it.

00:30:43.838 --> 00:30:45.655
She's upset about the immorality of it.

00:30:45.996 --> 00:30:47.428
She was raised to believe

00:30:47.428 --> 00:30:49.404
That if you do something
wrong, you get punished.

00:30:50.149 --> 00:30:51.853
Okay,  so she's conflicted,

00:30:52.164 --> 00:30:53.694
And the spirit of preacher karns

00:30:53.694 --> 00:30:55.248
Is latching onto her emotions

00:30:55.248 --> 00:30:56.733
And doing the punishing for her.

00:30:56.909 --> 00:30:57.772
Right.

00:30:58.113 --> 00:30:59.533
Rich comes on too strong.

00:30:59.703 --> 00:31:01.552
Taylor tries to make
her into a party girl.

00:31:02.122 --> 00:31:03.389
Dad has an affair.

00:31:04.099 --> 00:31:05.714
Remind me not to piss this girl off.

00:31:07.895 --> 00:31:09.938
But I burned those bones.I
buried them in salt.

00:31:10.190 --> 00:31:11.323
Why didn't that stop him?

00:31:12.637 --> 00:31:14.013
You must've missed something.

00:31:15.695 --> 00:31:17.655
No,  I burned everything in that coffin.

00:31:19.019 --> 00:31:20.247
Did you get the hook?

00:31:22.097 --> 00:31:22.897
The hook?

00:31:24.641 --> 00:31:25.662
It was the murder weapon,

00:31:25.839 --> 00:31:27.614
And in a way it was part of him.

00:31:30.515 --> 00:31:31.846
So,  like the bones,

00:31:31.846 --> 00:31:33.342
The hook is a source of his power.

00:31:34.327 --> 00:31:35.801
So,  if we find the hook...

00:31:36.070 --> 00:31:37.694
We stop the hookman.

00:31:45.795 --> 00:31:46.975
Here's something, I think.

00:31:48.490 --> 00:31:50.342
Log book, iowa state penitentiary.

00:31:50.342 --> 00:31:51.403
"Karns,
jacob --

00:31:51.403 --> 00:31:53.701
Personal affects, disposition there of."

00:31:53.701 --> 00:31:54.564
Does it mention the hook?

00:31:56.345 --> 00:31:58.847
"Upon execution,  all earthly
items shall be remanded

00:31:58.847 --> 00:32:00.082
"To the prisoner's houseof worship,

00:32:00.247 --> 00:32:01.504
St. Barnabas church."

00:32:02.953 --> 00:32:04.541
Isn't that where lori's father preaches?

00:32:04.541 --> 00:32:05.076
Yeah.

00:32:06.368 --> 00:32:07.501
Where lori lives?

00:32:08.079 --> 00:32:09.944
That's why the hookman'sbeen
haunting reverends

00:32:09.944 --> 00:32:12.095
And reverends' daughters
for the past 200 years.

00:32:12.095 --> 00:32:14.157
But if the hook were at
the church or lori's house,

00:32:14.157 --> 00:32:15.453
Don't you think someone
might've seen it?

00:32:15.830 --> 00:32:18.406
I mean,  a blood-Stained,
silver-Handled hook?

00:32:20.441 --> 00:32:21.581
Check the church records.

00:32:24.130 --> 00:32:26.614
"St. Barnabas donations, 1862.

00:32:26.614 --> 00:32:28.285
"Received
--Silver-Handled hook

00:32:28.439 --> 00:32:29.737
"From state penitentiary.

00:32:30.857 --> 00:32:31.624
Reforged."

00:32:33.126 --> 00:32:36.083
They melted it down, made
it into something else.

00:32:51.021 --> 00:32:52.417
All right.We can't take any chances.

00:32:52.417 --> 00:32:53.856
Anything silver goes in the fire.

00:32:54.211 --> 00:32:55.208
I agree.

00:32:56.282 --> 00:32:57.492
Lori's still at the hospital.

00:32:57.492 --> 00:32:58.508
We'll have to break in.

00:32:58.891 --> 00:32:59.974
All right, take your pick.

00:33:00.694 --> 00:33:01.575
I'll take the house.

00:33:02.056 --> 00:33:02.624
Okay.

00:33:05.316 --> 00:33:06.300
Hey.

00:33:07.912 --> 00:33:09.368
Stay out of her underwear drawer.

00:33:27.106 --> 00:33:28.864
I got everything that even looks silver.

00:33:28.864 --> 00:33:29.903
Better safe than sorry.

00:33:44.871 --> 00:33:45.694
Move,  move.

00:34:19.778 --> 00:34:20.643
Lori?

00:34:22.436 --> 00:34:23.706
What are you doing here?

00:34:23.706 --> 00:34:24.547
What is it?

00:34:25.763 --> 00:34:29.676
I've been trying to understand
what's been happening,  why.

00:34:30.023 --> 00:34:32.835
Now I know,  so I'm
praying for forgiveness.

00:34:33.746 --> 00:34:35.310
Forgiveness for what?

00:34:35.785 --> 00:34:36.983
Don't you see?

00:34:37.058 --> 00:34:38.768
I'm to blame for all this.

00:34:39.607 --> 00:34:42.704
I've read in the bible
about avenging angels.

00:34:42.782 --> 00:34:43.190
Trust me.

00:34:43.190 --> 00:34:46.469
This guy --
He's no angel.

00:34:47.403 --> 00:34:49.797
I was so angry at my father.

00:34:50.517 --> 00:34:52.461
Part of me wanted him punished,

00:34:53.695 --> 00:34:55.861
And then he came and he punished him.

00:34:56.075 --> 00:34:57.442
It's not your fault.

00:34:57.946 --> 00:34:59.177
Yes,  it is.

00:34:59.619 --> 00:35:01.179
I don't know how, but it is.

00:35:03.541 --> 00:35:04.582
I killed rich.

00:35:04.924 --> 00:35:05.936
Taylor,  too.

00:35:06.337 --> 00:35:07.929
I nearly killed my father.

00:35:08.363 --> 00:35:09.035
Lori.

00:35:11.131 --> 00:35:12.265
I can see it now.

00:35:13.317 --> 00:35:15.011
They didn't deserve to be punished.

00:35:15.381 --> 00:35:16.245
I do.

00:35:28.147 --> 00:35:29.871
Come on.We got to go.

00:35:39.170 --> 00:35:39.872
Go!

00:35:41.505 --> 00:35:42.234
Come on!

00:36:03.397 --> 00:36:04.182
No!

00:36:13.431 --> 00:36:15.144
Come on,  get up.

00:36:29.913 --> 00:36:30.960
Sam,  drop!

00:36:37.313 --> 00:36:38.620
I thought we got all the silver.

00:36:39.379 --> 00:36:40.482
Why is he still here?

00:36:40.517 --> 00:36:41.868
Maybe we missed something.

00:36:44.776 --> 00:36:46.494
Lori,  where did you getthat chain?

00:36:47.103 --> 00:36:48.280
My father gave it to me.

00:36:48.408 --> 00:36:49.294
Where'd your dad get it?

00:36:49.296 --> 00:36:51.183
It was a church
heirloom.He gave it to me.

00:36:51.916 --> 00:36:52.630
Is it silver?

00:36:52.630 --> 00:36:53.110
Yes.

00:37:10.497 --> 00:37:11.196
Sam.

00:38:21.745 --> 00:38:24.380
And you saw him,  too,
the man with the hook?

00:38:24.404 --> 00:38:26.160
Yes,  I told you.We all saw him.

00:38:26.160 --> 00:38:28.017
We fought him off, and then he ran.

00:38:28.569 --> 00:38:29.293
And that's all?

00:38:30.044 --> 00:38:30.853
Yeah,  that's all.

00:38:34.532 --> 00:38:36.669
Listen, you and
your brother --

00:38:36.669 --> 00:38:38.084
Oh,  don't worry.We're leaving town.

00:38:44.933 --> 00:38:46.006
You gonna be okay?

00:38:46.910 --> 00:38:47.855
Yeah.

00:38:57.989 --> 00:38:59.368
I still don't know what happened,

00:39:00.559 --> 00:39:03.399
But I do know you saved my life.

00:39:04.116 --> 00:39:05.275
My father's,  too.

00:39:05.746 --> 00:39:06.581
Thank you.

00:39:32.115 --> 00:39:33.139
We could stay.



